   ],
   "style": "prose",
   "field": "description",
   "en": "A stray blast of the neothelid’s acidic breath weapon sprays over the battlefield; everyone takes @Damage[8d6[acid]] damage with a @Check[dc:33|basic:true|type:reflex] save.",
   "current": null
  },
  {
   "path": [
    "entries",
    "Abomination Vaults: Expanded",
    "tables",
    "Moriggna x Neolithid Battle",
    "results",
    "gph0PwDqhAaj6hou",
    "description"
   ],
   "style": "prose",
   "field": "description",
   "en": "The neothelid’s telepathy brushes the minds of the party with whispers of the unfathomable. The voidgluttons are immune, but the party makes @Check[dc:28|type:will] Save. The heroes become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1} on a <b>failure</b>, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.yblD8fOR1J8rDwEQ]{Confused} for 1 round on a <b>critical failure</b>",
   "current": null
  },
  {
   "path": [
    "entries",
    "Abomination Vaults: Expanded",
    "tables",
    "Moriggna x Neolithid Battle",
    "results",
    "DKnxrAaNzBKUroTQ",
    "description"
   ],
   "style": "prose",
   "field": "description",
   "en": "A wave of positive energy originating from the morrigna washes over the battlefield. The voidgluttons are immune, but the heroes are healed for @Damage[4d8[healing,vitality,magical]].",
   "current": null
  },
  {
   "path": [
    "entries",
    "Abomination Vaults: Expanded",
    "tables",
    "Moriggna x Neolithid Battle",
    "results",
    "FaJbZE3MERY8CX9V",
    "description"
   ],
   "style": "prose",
   "field": "description",
   "en": "Skittering spirit spiders and strands of webbing from the morrigna’s wrappings have drifted over to clutter up the battlefield. Everyone must attempt a @Check[dc:28|type:reflex] save, take @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.I4PsUAaYSUJ8pwKC]{-10 penalty to all speeds} for 1 round on <b>failure</b>, being instead @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} for 1 round  on a <b>critical failure</b>.",
   "current": null
  },
  {
   "path": [
    "entries",
    "Abomination Vaults: Expanded",
    "tables",
    "Moriggna x Neolithid Battle",
    "results",
    "D2lyBoH3pLAQHRux",
    "description"
   ],
   "style": "prose",
   "field": "description",
   "en": "The neothelid briefly loses control, spreading horrifying apocalyptic visions in psychic flashes through the battlefield. The voidgluttons are immune, but the party must roll a @Check[dc:33|type:will|traits:mental,illusion] save. This has the effect of the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.0XP2XOxT9VSiXFDr]{Phantasmal Calamity} spell, except that it deals only @Damage[8d6[mental,illusion]] damage and cannot stun a target for more than one round.<hr />@Embed[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.0XP2XOxT9VSiXFDr]",
   "current": null
  },
  {
   "path": [
    "entries",
