    "Moriggna x Neolithid Battle",
    "results",
    "nagxRAkFnpKdGAUv",
    "description"
   ],
   "style": "prose",
   "field": "description",
   "en": "The morrigna briefly gains the upper hand in a dramatic fashion, inspiring the heroes with the thought of this powerful extraplanar ally fighting at their side against the forces of evil. The party gains the effect of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.IAjvwqgiDr3qGYxY]{Courageous Anthem} for one round.<br />@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.beReeFroAx24hj83]{Spell Effect: Courageous Anthem}",
   "current": null
  },
